 "tail": 2.3,
 "lines": [
  {
   "o": 0,
   "text": "This week, 86 of the world's 100 most polluted cities were in one country.",
   "chunks": [
    "THIS WEEK, *86*|OF THE WORLD'S *100*",
    "MOST POLLUTED CITIES",
    "WERE IN|*ONE COUNTRY.*"
   ]
  },
  {
   "o": 0,
   "text": "One Delhi station hit 488. The scale stops at 500.",
   "chunks": [
    "ONE DELHI STATION|HIT *488.*",
    "THE SCALE|STOPS AT *500.*"
   ]
  },
  {
   "o": 0,
   "text": "So why here? From space, it's a grey river, Punjab to Bengal.",
   "chunks": [
    "SO WHY *HERE?*",
    "FROM *SPACE,*|IT'S A GREY RIVER,",
    "*PUNJAB* TO *BENGAL.*"
   ]
  },
  {
   "o": 0,
   "text": "4 in 10 Indians live under it.",
   "chunks": [
    "*4 IN 10* INDIANS|LIVE UNDER IT."
   ]
  },
  {
   "o": 0,
   "text": "Because north India is a giant bowl.",
   "chunks": [
    "BECAUSE NORTH INDIA|IS A *GIANT BOWL.*"
   ]
  },
  {
   "o": 0,
   "text": "North, the tallest wall on Earth.",
   "chunks": [
    "NORTH, THE *TALLEST WALL*|ON EARTH."
   ]
  },
  {
   "o": 0,
   "text": "Nothing gets past me. Not even smoke.",
   "chunks": [
    "NOTHING GETS|*PAST ME.*",
    "NOT EVEN *SMOKE.*"
   ],
   "speaker": "him"
  },
  {
   "o": 0,
   "text": "South, the Aravalli and Vindhya hills.",
   "chunks": [
    "SOUTH, THE *ARAVALLI*|AND *VINDHYA* HILLS."
   ]
  },
  {
   "o": 0,
   "text": "But it's been a bowl for millions of years. So why only in winter?",
   "chunks": [
    "BUT IT'S BEEN A BOWL|FOR *MILLIONS OF YEARS.*",
    "SO WHY ONLY|IN *WINTER?*"
   ]
  },
  {
   "o": 0,
   "text": "In summer, warm air rises about a kilometre and takes the smoke away.",
   "chunks": [
    "IN *SUMMER,*|WARM AIR RISES",
    "ABOUT A *KILOMETRE*",
    "AND TAKES|THE SMOKE *AWAY.*"
   ]
  },
  {
   "o": 0,
   "text": "In November, cold air slides off the Tibetan Plateau and warm air sits on top.",
   "chunks": [
    "IN *NOVEMBER,*|COLD AIR SLIDES",
    "OFF THE *TIBETAN PLATEAU*",
    "AND WARM AIR|SITS *ON TOP.*"
   ]
  },
  {
   "o": 0,
   "text": "Like a lid on a pot.",
   "chunks": [
    "LIKE A *LID*|ON A POT."
   ]
  },
  {
   "o": 0,
   "text": "The ceiling drops to a few hundred metres, and the wind goes quiet.",
   "chunks": [
    "THE CEILING DROPS",
    "TO A *FEW HUNDRED METRES,*",
    "AND THE WIND|GOES *QUIET.*"
   ]
  },
  {
   "o": 0,
   "text": "And that's still not the strangest part.",
   "chunks": [
    "AND THAT'S STILL NOT|THE *STRANGEST PART.*"
   ]
  },
  {
   "o": 0,
   "text": "Researchers say even if Delhi made zero pollution itself,",
   "chunks": [
    "RESEARCHERS SAY|EVEN IF DELHI",
    "MADE *ZERO*|POLLUTION ITSELF,"
   ]
  },
  {
   "o": 0,
   "text": "its winter air would likely still turn bad.",
   "chunks": [
    "ITS WINTER AIR|WOULD LIKELY",
    "STILL *TURN BAD.*"
   ]
  },
  {
   "o": 0,
   "text": "Because smoke from farms, roads and factories across the plain shares one sky.",
   "chunks": [
    "BECAUSE SMOKE FROM|*FARMS, ROADS*",
    "AND *FACTORIES*|ACROSS THE PLAIN",
    "SHARES *ONE SKY.*"
   ]
  },
  {
   "o": 0,
   "text": "Air doesn't stop at city lines.",
   "chunks": [
    "AIR DOESN'T STOP|AT *CITY LINES.*"
   ]
  },
  {
   "o": 0,
   "text": "Don't look at me. I'm just tall.",
   "chunks": [
    "DON'T LOOK|AT ME.",
    "I'M JUST *TALL.*"
   ],
   "speaker": "him"
  },
  {
   "o": 0,
   "text": "Comment your city's AQI right now.",
   "chunks": [
    "COMMENT YOUR CITY'S|*AQI* RIGHT NOW."
   ]
  },
  {
   "o": 0,
   "text": "This is BHUGOL. Follow for more Geography Fun Facts.",
   "chunks": [
    "THIS IS *BHUGOL.*",
    "FOLLOW FOR MORE|GEOGRAPHY FUN FACTS."
   ]
  }
 ],
